---
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '');
---

<section id="inicio" class="on-dark relative pt-[196px] pb-[110px] text-center text-white bg-deep noise gridlines inner-depth overflow-hidden">
  <div data-px="0.22" class="absolute inset-0 z-0">
    <img src={`${base}/fondo-fractal-hosting.avif`} alt="Montañas de la Patagonia con líneas de datos y servidores de Fractal Host" width="1923" height="1253" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" class="w-full h-full object-cover opacity-70 scale-110" />
  </div>
  <div class="absolute inset-0 z-[2] bg-gradient-to-b from-night/90 via-night/55 to-night/95"></div>
  <div class="absolute inset-0 z-[2] bg-[radial-gradient(115%_85%_at_50%_38%,rgba(4,7,13,0)_0%,rgba(4,7,13,.55)_58%,rgba(4,7,13,.92)_100%)]" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div data-px="0.1" class="absolute -top-28 -left-28 w-[440px] h-[440px] rounded-full bg-cy/20 blur-[130px] z-[2]" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div data-px="-0.07" class="absolute top-1/3 -right-32 w-[400px] h-[400px] rounded-full bg-[#1B74E4]/25 blur-[120px] z-[2]" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <svg data-px="0.12" viewBox="0 0 1440 260" preserveAspectRatio="none" class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-full h-[200px] z-[3] opacity-50" aria-hidden="true"><path fill="#0A1A33" d="M0 260 L0 170 L170 80 L330 160 L520 55 L720 150 L900 70 L1080 165 L1260 95 L1440 175 L1440 260 Z"/></svg>
  <svg data-px="0.06" viewBox="0 0 1440 220" preserveAspectRatio="none" class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-full h-[160px] z-[4] opacity-80" aria-hidden="true"><path fill="#071120" d="M0 220 L0 150 L220 70 L420 140 L640 50 L860 135 L1060 65 L1260 145 L1440 90 L1440 220 Z"/></svg>
  <svg viewBox="0 0 1440 160" preserveAspectRatio="none" class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-full h-[110px] z-[5]" aria-hidden="true"><path fill="#04070D" d="M0 160 L0 120 L260 60 L500 115 L760 45 L1020 110 L1240 60 L1440 115 L1440 160 Z"/></svg>

  <div id="heroSlider" class="relative z-10 wrap min-h-[560px] flex items-center justify-center">
    <div class="slide is-active" data-slide="0" role="group" aria-roledescription="lámina" aria-label="Servicio de hosting en Punta Arenas">
      <div class="w-full text-center">
        <span class="kicker on-dark">Servicio de hosting en Punta Arenas</span>
        <h1 class="font-display font-extrabold uppercase tracking-[.02em] text-[clamp(1.7rem,3.8vw,2.8rem)] leading-tight mt-4 drop-shadow-[0_6px_30px_rgba(0,0,0,.6)]">Hosting profesional en <span class="text-yel drop-shadow-[0_0_22px_rgba(255,230,0,.35)]">Punta Arenas</span> y la Patagonia</h1>
        <p class="mt-4 mb-8 mx-auto max-w-[760px] text-[#DCE6F0] text-[1.08rem]">Te damos el espacio en servidor que necesitas para publicar tu <strong>página web</strong> y tener tus <strong>correos electrónicos corporativos</strong> (como contacto@tuempresa.cl), respaldado con infraestructura en el Cono Sur para máxima velocidad.</p>
        <div class="mx-auto mb-8 flex flex-col items-center gap-3">
          <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-2">
            <span class="pill-clean"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-width="2" class="w-4 h-4 stroke-cyt" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg>Actualización de plugins y plantillas*</span>
            <span class="pill-clean"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-width="2" class="w-4 h-4 stroke-cyt" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg>Corrección de errores en tu sitio*</span>
            <span class="pill-clean"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-width="2" class="w-4 h-4 stroke-cyt" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg>Si tu sitio sufre un hackeo, lo recuperamos y desinfectamos sin cobro extra*</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-[.72rem] text-[#9FB0C2]">* Aplica a sitios creados por nosotros y alojados con nosotros.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-3">
          <a href="#hosting-global" class="inline-flex bg-yel hover:bg-yelhov text-ink font-display font-bold text-[.98rem] px-10 py-3.5 rounded-md shadow-[0_6px_20px_rgba(255,230,0,.28)] hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all">Ver planes de hosting</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="slide" data-slide="1" role="group" aria-roledescription="lámina" aria-label="Creación de sitios web en Punta Arenas">
      <div class="w-full max-w-[900px] mx-auto text-center">
        <span class="kicker on-dark">Creación de sitios web en Punta Arenas</span>
        <p class="font-display font-extrabold uppercase tracking-[.02em] text-[clamp(1.7rem,3.8vw,2.8rem)] leading-tight mt-4 drop-shadow-[0_6px_30px_rgba(0,0,0,.6)]">Tu sitio web listo desde <span class="text-yel drop-shadow-[0_0_22px_rgba(255,230,0,.35)]">24 horas</span></p>
        <p class="mt-4 mb-8 mx-auto max-w-[760px] text-[#DCE6F0] text-[1.08rem]">Micrositio en 24 h · One Page 3 a 7 días · Sitio de empresa 1 a 3 semanas · Tienda en línea 15 a 45 días. Con dominio .cl y primer año de hosting incluidos.</p>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-3">
          <a href={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, "")}/cotizador`} class="inline-flex bg-yel hover:bg-yelhov text-ink font-display font-bold text-[.98rem] px-10 py-3.5 rounded-md shadow-[0_6px_20px_rgba(255,230,0,.28)] hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all">Cotizar mi sitio</a>
          <a href="#sitios-web" class="inline-flex border-2 border-white/40 hover:border-cy hover:text-cyt text-white font-display font-bold text-[.98rem] px-8 py-3.5 rounded-md transition-colors">Ver cómo trabajamos</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="slide" data-slide="2" role="group" aria-roledescription="lámina" aria-label="Mantención, seguridad y soluciones digitales">
      <div class="w-full max-w-[900px] mx-auto text-center">
        <span class="kicker on-dark">Mantención, seguridad y soluciones digitales</span>
        <p class="font-display font-extrabold uppercase tracking-[.02em] text-[clamp(1.7rem,3.8vw,2.8rem)] leading-tight mt-4 drop-shadow-[0_6px_30px_rgba(0,0,0,.6)]">Tu <span class="text-yel drop-shadow-[0_0_22px_rgba(255,230,0,.35)]">aliado digital</span> en la Patagonia: más que hosting</p>
        <p class="mt-4 mb-8 mx-auto max-w-[760px] text-[#DCE6F0] text-[1.08rem]">Transformamos tus ideas en proyectos digitales completos. Te acompañamos con mantención continua, seguridad informática contra ciberataques, adaptación a la Ley 21.719 y soporte directo.</p>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-3">
          <a href="#mantencion" class="inline-flex bg-yel hover:bg-yelhov text-ink font-display font-bold text-[.98rem] px-10 py-3.5 rounded-md shadow-[0_6px_20px_rgba(255,230,0,.28)] hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all">Ver mantención y seguridad</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="relative z-10 wrap mt-8 flex items-center justify-center gap-5">
    <button id="slidePrev" aria-label="Lámina anterior" class="w-11 h-11 rounded-full border border-white/30 hover:border-cy hover:text-cyt flex items-center justify-center transition-colors cursor-pointer"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-width="2.4" class="w-4 h-4 stroke-current" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M15 6l-6 6 6 6"/></svg></button>
    <div id="slideDots" class="flex items-center gap-2.5" role="tablist" aria-label="Láminas del inicio"></div>
    <button id="slideNext" aria-label="Lámina siguiente" class="w-11 h-11 rounded-full border border-white/30 hover:border-cy hover:text-cyt flex items-center justify-center transition-colors cursor-pointer"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-width="2.4" class="w-4 h-4 stroke-current" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M9 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></button>
  </div>
</section>
